# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile reads. Everything else, including
# data/ (datasets, runs and data/secrets/*.env), .git, target/ and the machine-local
# rust-toolchain.toml and .cargo/config.toml (Windows-only settings), never reaches the builder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!docs/LIMITATIONS.md
!web/

# Re-excluded inside allowed directories.
**/target
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
web/.env*
